    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<p>This curse affects one person at a time. The current cursebearer is Natanya Rajani, Carman's mother.</p>\n<h2 data-anchor=\"stages\">Stages</h2>\n<p><strong>Savings Throw</strong>: None - when the cursebearer dies, the curse passes automatically to the nearest adult Rajani who is within same generation; otherwise it passes to the nearest adult Rajani in the subsequent generation.</p>\n<p>If there are no adults are available, the onset will not begin until the oldest minor is sixteen years old.</p>\n<p>The curse will try to exhaust all members of one generation before moving to another, but it can only move to a person who is near the cursebearer at his or her time of death. It can move to a spouse, but only if the marriage produced children.</p>\n<p><strong>Onset: 1</strong> Year</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong>: Disposition toward family members, romantic attachments and beloved friends changes to <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA\" data-id=\"fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Indifferent</a> - 1 year</p>\n<p>From this point, the curse has no effect when the accursed is alone. Additionally, the accursed is unable to inflict self-harm.</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong>: Disposition toward friends changes to <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u\" data-id=\"I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Unfriendly</a> = 1 year, plus the accursed is <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Stupefied 2</a> vs. Charisma and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Stupefied 1</a> vs. Wisdom.</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong>: Disposition toward acquaintances changes to Unfriendly - 1 year, plus the accursed is <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Stupefied 4</a> vs. Charisma and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Stupefied 2</a> vs. Wisdom.</p>\n<p>It does not change negative dispositions.</p>\n<p>Once the curse reaches Stage 3, it remains at that stage for life unless counteracted with a <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0\" data-id=\"SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.spells-srd\" data-tooltip=\"Spell Item\">Cleanse Affliction</a> heightened to Rank 4. Caster DC: 28 (<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary.Actor.WQy7HBUcgDLsfVJd\" data-id=\"WQy7HBUcgDLsfVJd\" data-type=\"Actor\" data-pack=\"pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary\" data-tooltip=\"NPC Actor\">Night Hag</a>).</p>",
      "<p>该诅咒一次只影响一个人。当前的受诅者是纳坦雅·拉贾尼，卡尔曼的母亲。</p>\n<h2 data-anchor=\"stages\">阶段</h2>\n<p><strong>豁免检定</strong>：无——当受诅者死亡时，诅咒会自动传递给同一代中距离最近的成年拉贾尼；否则传递给下一代中距离最近的成年拉贾尼。</p>\n<p>如果没有成年者可用，则潜伏期不会开始，直到最年长的未成年人满十六岁。</p>\n<p>诅咒会试图在转移到另一代之前耗尽同一代的所有成员，但它只能转移到在受诅者死亡时靠近他或她的人身上。它也可以转移到配偶身上，但仅限于该婚姻有子女。</p>\n<p><strong>潜伏期：1</strong> 年</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong>：对家庭成员、恋爱对象与挚爱好友的态度变为<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA\" data-id=\"fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">不关心</a> - 1年</p>\n<p>从此刻起，当受诅者独处时，该诅咒没有效果。此外，受诅者无法对自己施加自我伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong>：对朋友的态度变为<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u\" data-id=\"I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">不友好</a> = 1年，且受诅者在魅力方面处于<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">呆滞 2</a>，在感知方面处于<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">呆滞 1</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong>：对熟人的态度变为不友好 - 1年，且受诅者在魅力方面处于<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">呆滞 4</a>，在感知方面处于<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">呆滞 2</a>。</p>\n<p>它不会改变负面态度。</p>\n<p>一旦诅咒到达阶段 3，除非以升阶至4环的<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0\" data-id=\"SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.spells-srd\" data-tooltip=\"法术条目\">净化苦难</a>进行反制，否则它会终生停留在该阶段。施法者DC：28（<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary.Actor.WQy7HBUcgDLsfVJd\" data-id=\"WQy7HBUcgDLsfVJd\" data-type=\"Actor\" data-pack=\"pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary\" data-tooltip=\"非玩家角色\">夜魇鬼婆</a>）。</p>"
    ],
