    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<p>Vol launches an insightful quip at a foe, distracting them. She chooses a foe within 30 feet and roll a <span class=\"with-repost\" data-pf2-action=\"bonMot\" data-pf2-glyph=\"A\">Diplomacy</span> check against the target's Will DC.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is distracted and takes a -3 status penalty to Perception and Will saves for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-id=\"CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"Effect Item\">Effect: Bon Mot (Critical Success)</a></p>\n<p>The target can end the effect early with a retort to her Bon Mot. This can either be a single action that has the concentrate trait or an appropriate skill action to frame their retort. The GM determines which skill actions qualify, though they must take at least 1 action. Typically, the retort needs to use a linguistic Charisma-based skill action.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but the penalty is -2.</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-id=\"GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"Effect Item\">Effect: Bon Mot</a></p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Vol's quip is atrocious. You take the same penalty an enemy would take had you succeeded. This ends after 1 minute or if you issue another Bon Mot and succeed.</p>",
      "<p>沃尔向一名敌人抛出一句犀利的俏皮话，使其分心。她选择30尺内的一名敌人，并对抗该目标的意志DC进行一次<span class=\"with-repost\" data-pf2-action=\"bonMot\" data-pf2-glyph=\"A\">交涉</span>检定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标分心，在1分钟内其察觉与意志豁免承受-3状态减值。</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-id=\"CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"效果条目\">效果：当头棒喝（大成功）</a></p>\n<p>目标可以用对她当头棒喝的回击来提前结束该效果。这可以是一个带有专注特征的单动作，或一个用于组织其回击的适当技能动作。由GM决定哪些技能动作符合条件，但它们至少必须花费1个动作。通常，回击需要使用一个带有语言特征、以魅力为基础的技能动作。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同大成功，但减值为-2。</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-id=\"GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"效果条目\">效果：当头棒喝</a></p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 沃尔的俏皮话糟糕透顶。你承受与敌人在你成功时会承受的相同减值。该效果在1分钟后结束，或当你再次使用当头棒喝并成功时结束。</p>",
      "<p>Vol launches an insightful quip at a foe, distracting them. She chooses a foe within 30 feet and roll a <span class=\"with-repost\" data-pf2-action=\"bonMot\" data-pf2-glyph=\"A\">Diplomacy</span> check against the target's Will DC.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is distracted and takes a -3 status penalty to Perception and Will saves for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-id=\"CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"Effect Item\">Effect: Bon Mot (Critical Success)</a></p>\n<p>The target can end the effect early with a retort to her Bon Mot. This can either be a single action that has the concentrate trait or an appropriate skill action to frame their retort. The GM determines which skill actions qualify, though they must take at least 1 action. Typically, the retort needs to use a linguistic Charisma-based skill action.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but the penalty is -2.</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-id=\"GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"Effect Item\">Effect: Bon Mot</a></p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Vol's quip is atrocious. You take the same penalty an enemy would take had you succeeded. This ends after 1 minute or if you issue another Bon Mot and succeed.</p>",
      "<p>沃尔向一名敌人抛出一句犀利的俏皮话，使其分心。她选择30尺内的一名敌人，并对抗该目标的意志DC进行一次<span class=\"with-repost\" data-pf2-action=\"bonMot\" data-pf2-glyph=\"A\">交涉</span>检定。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标分心，在1分钟内其察觉与意志豁免承受-3状态减值。</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-id=\"CtrZFI3RV0yPNzTv\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"效果条目\">效果：当头棒喝（大成功）</a></p>\n<p>目标可以用对她当头棒喝的回击来提前结束该效果。这可以是一个带有专注特征的单动作，或一个用于组织其回击的适当技能动作。由GM决定哪些技能动作符合条件，但它们至少必须花费1个动作。通常，回击需要使用一个带有语言特征、以魅力为基础的技能动作。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同大成功，但减值为-2。</p>\n<p><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-id=\"GoSls6SKCFmSoDxT\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.feat-effects\" data-tooltip=\"效果条目\">效果：当头棒喝</a></p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 沃尔的俏皮话糟糕透顶。你承受与敌人在你成功时会承受的相同减值。该效果在1分钟后结束，或当你再次使用当头棒喝并成功时结束。</p>"
    ],
