    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<section class=\"npc\">\n<article>\n<p>He explains that he hails from a small drow settlement deeper underground called Yldaris, but he’s unwilling to give much detail about Yldaris to strangers. He says only that the city welcomes traders and that the heroes should visit, peacefully, if they come to the area. Falxi and two other drow were scouting farther from their settlement than usual when urdefhans attacked them; he was knocked unconscious and somehow ended up here.</p>\n</article>\n<figure class=\"flipx\"><img src=\"modules/pf2e-abomination-vaults/assets/bestiary-portraits/ch-06/falxi-orshendiel.webp\" width=\"230\" /></figure>\n</section>\n<p>If the heroes let him go, he eventually returns to Yldaris and might meet the heroes in area <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.1vlzl3NJsftNB9Dc.JournalEntryPage.bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-id=\"bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"Text Page\">I06</a>. The heroes’ encounter with Falxi should suggest that Yldaris is a safe place to visit, and set the stage for a peaceful encounter with drow living in the lower levels.</p>\n<p>Hunters seek out game to keep drow communities fed and functioning.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Drow have a reputation for evil due to demon worship in their major settlements. However, like members of any ancestry, drow can have any alignment, especially when removed from the demon lords' sinister influence.</p>",
      "<section class=\"npc\">\n<article>\n<p>他解释说自己来自更深处地下一个名为伊尔达里斯的小型卓尔聚居地，但他不愿向陌生人透露太多关于伊尔达里斯的细节。他只说这座城市欢迎商人，如果英雄们来到该区域，应该以和平方式前往拜访。法尔西·奥申迪尔和另外两名卓尔当时在比平常更远的地方侦察，透肌魔人袭击了他们；他被打昏，不知怎的就到了这里。</p>\n</article>\n<figure class=\"flipx\"><img src=\"modules/pf2e-abomination-vaults/assets/bestiary-portraits/ch-06/falxi-orshendiel.webp\" width=\"230\" /></figure>\n</section>\n<p>如果英雄们放他离开，他最终会返回伊尔达里斯，并可能在区域 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.1vlzl3NJsftNB9Dc.JournalEntryPage.bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-id=\"bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"文本页\">I06</a> 与英雄们相遇。英雄们与法尔西的遭遇应当暗示伊尔达里斯是一个可以安全拜访的地方，并为与生活在地城下层的卓尔和平相遇做好铺垫。</p>\n<p>猎手们搜寻猎物，以维持卓尔社群的供给与运作。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>由于在其主要聚居地崇拜恶魔，卓尔有着邪恶的名声。然而，如同任何族裔的成员一样，卓尔也可能拥有任何阵营，尤其是在脱离恶魔领主阴险影响时。</p>",
      "<section class=\"npc\">\n<article>\n<p>He explains that he hails from a small drow settlement deeper underground called Yldaris, but he’s unwilling to give much detail about Yldaris to strangers. He says only that the city welcomes traders and that the heroes should visit, peacefully, if they come to the area. Falxi and two other drow were scouting farther from their settlement than usual when urdefhans attacked them; he was knocked unconscious and somehow ended up here.</p>\n</article>\n<figure class=\"flipx\"><img src=\"modules/pf2e-abomination-vaults/assets/bestiary-portraits/ch-06/falxi-orshendiel.webp\" width=\"230\"></figure>\n</section>\n<p>If the heroes let him go, he eventually returns to Yldaris and might meet the heroes in area <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.1vlzl3NJsftNB9Dc.JournalEntryPage.bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-id=\"bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"Text Page\">I06</a>. The heroes’ encounter with Falxi should suggest that Yldaris is a safe place to visit, and set the stage for a peaceful encounter with drow living in the lower levels.</p>\n<p>Hunters seek out game to keep drow communities fed and functioning.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Drow have a reputation for evil due to demon worship in their major settlements. However, like members of any ancestry, drow can have any alignment, especially when removed from the demon lords' sinister influence.</p>",
      "<section class=\"npc\">\n<article>\n<p>他解释说自己来自更深处地下一个名为伊尔达里斯的小型卓尔聚居地，但他不愿向陌生人透露太多关于伊尔达里斯的细节。他只说这座城市欢迎商人，如果英雄们来到该区域，应该以和平方式前往拜访。法尔西·奥申迪尔和另外两名卓尔当时在比平常更远的地方侦察，透肌魔人袭击了他们；他被打昏，不知怎的就到了这里。</p>\n</article>\n<figure class=\"flipx\"><img src=\"modules/pf2e-abomination-vaults/assets/bestiary-portraits/ch-06/falxi-orshendiel.webp\" width=\"230\"></figure>\n</section>\n<p>如果英雄们放他离开，他最终会返回伊尔达里斯，并可能在区域 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.1vlzl3NJsftNB9Dc.JournalEntryPage.bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-id=\"bRyY0W8o867mTMNj\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"文本页\">I06</a> 与英雄们相遇。英雄们与法尔西的遭遇应当暗示伊尔达里斯是一个可以安全拜访的地方，并为与生活在地城下层的卓尔和平相遇做好铺垫。</p>\n<p>猎手们搜寻猎物，以维持卓尔社群的供给与运作。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>由于在其主要聚居地崇拜恶魔，卓尔有着邪恶的名声。然而，如同任何族裔的成员一样，卓尔也可能拥有任何阵营，尤其是在脱离恶魔领主阴险影响时。</p>"
    ],
