    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<ul class=\"traits\">\n<li>This fast-acting disease causes tiny spores to take root under the skin and blossom in the lungs or in the bloodstream. You become easily winded and incapable of moving quickly. You can’t reduce your sickened condition while afflicted with fungal rot.\n<section class=\"traits\"></section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw:</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-roll-options=\"damaging-effect\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"fort\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"fort DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fort\" data-pf2-dc=\"22\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 22</span> Fortitude</span></a></p>\n<p><strong>Onset:</strong> 1 hour</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stage 1</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\" data-id=\"fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\">Sickened 1</a> (1 day)</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 2</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\" data-id=\"xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\">Slowed 1</a> and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\" data-id=\"fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\">Sickened 1</a> (1 day)</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 3</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\" data-id=\"xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\">Slowed 2</a> and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\" data-id=\"fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\">Sickened 3</a> (1 day)</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 4</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf\" data-id=\"fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf\">Unconscious</a> (1 day)</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 5</strong>: death</li>\n</ul>",
      "<ul class=\"traits\">\n<li>这种起效迅速的疾病会使微小的孢子在皮下扎根，并在肺部或血液中绽放。你会很容易气喘，且无法快速移动。在你被真菌腐烂折磨期间，你无法降低你的恶心。\n<section class=\"traits\"></section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>豁免检定：</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-roll-options=\"damaging-effect\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"fort\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"fort DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fort\" data-pf2-dc=\"22\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 22</span> 强韧</span></a></p>\n<p><strong>潜伏期：</strong> 1小时</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>阶段 1</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\" data-id=\"fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\">恶心 1</a> （1天）</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 2</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\" data-id=\"xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\">缓慢 1</a> 和 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\" data-id=\"fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\">恶心 1</a> （1天）</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 3</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\" data-id=\"xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3\">缓慢 2</a> 和 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\" data-id=\"fesd1n5eVhpCSS18\">恶心 3</a> （1天）</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 4</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf\" data-id=\"fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf\">失去意识</a> （1天）</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 5</strong>：死亡</li>\n</ul>"
    ],
