    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<p>This disease and any damage from it can't be healed until this curse is removed. A creature killed by mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-rank <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-id=\"kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.spells-srd\" data-tooltip=\"Spell Item\">Resurrect</a> ritual or similar magic.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"Mummy Rot\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"Mummy Rot DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fortitude\" data-pf2-dc=\"24\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 24</span> Fortitude</span></a></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> <a class=\"inline-roll roll\" data-formula=\"{6d6[void]}\" data-base-formula=\"6d6[void]\" data-damage-roll=\"6d6[void]\" data-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-item-id=\"5dn4uxBWvzHmjJF9\">6d6 void</a> damage and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Stupefied 1</a> (1 day)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Note: the disease itself does not kill the creature afflicted by Mummy Rot. The death effect applies once the curse causes enough void damage to put the creature in the Dying condition.</p>",
      "<p>该疾病及其造成的任何伤害在该诅咒被移除前都无法被治疗。被腐尸症杀死的生物会化为尘土，且无法起死回生，除非通过一个第7环的 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-id=\"kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.spells-srd\" data-tooltip=\"法术条目\">起死回生</a> 仪式或类似魔法。</p>\n<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"Mummy Rot\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"Mummy Rot DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fortitude\" data-pf2-dc=\"24\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 24</span> 强韧</span></a></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 携带者，无不良效果（1分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> <a class=\"inline-roll roll\" data-formula=\"{6d6[void]}\" data-base-formula=\"6d6[void]\" data-damage-roll=\"6d6[void]\" data-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-item-id=\"5dn4uxBWvzHmjJF9\">6d6 虚能</a> 伤害且 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">呆滞 1</a>（1天）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>注：该疾病本身不会杀死受腐尸症折磨的生物。死亡效果会在诅咒造成足够的虚能伤害使该生物进入濒死后生效。</p>",
      "<p>This disease and any damage from it can't be healed until this curse is removed. A creature killed by mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-rank <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-id=\"kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.spells-srd\" data-tooltip=\"Spell Item\">Resurrect</a> ritual or similar magic.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"Mummy Rot\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"Mummy Rot DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fortitude\" data-pf2-dc=\"24\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 24</span> Fortitude</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> <a class=\"inline-roll roll\" data-formula=\"{6d6[void]}\" data-base-formula=\"6d6[void]\" data-damage-roll=\"6d6[void]\" data-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-item-id=\"5dn4uxBWvzHmjJF9\">6d6 void</a> damage and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"Condition Item\">Stupefied 1</a> (1 day)</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Note: the disease itself does not kill the creature afflicted by Mummy Rot. The death effect applies once the curse causes enough void damage to put the creature in the Dying condition.</p>",
      "<p>该疾病及其造成的任何伤害在该诅咒被移除前都无法被治疗。被腐尸症杀死的生物会化为尘土，且无法起死回生，除非通过一个第7环的 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-id=\"kqhPt9344UkcGVYO\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.spells-srd\" data-tooltip=\"法术条目\">起死回生</a> 仪式或类似魔法。</p>\n<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"Mummy Rot\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"Mummy Rot DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fortitude\" data-pf2-dc=\"24\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 24</span> 强韧</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 携带者，无不良效果（1分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> <a class=\"inline-roll roll\" data-formula=\"{6d6[void]}\" data-base-formula=\"6d6[void]\" data-damage-roll=\"6d6[void]\" data-traits=\"curse,disease,divine,void\" data-item-id=\"5dn4uxBWvzHmjJF9\">6d6 虚能</a> 伤害且 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-type=\"Item\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-tooltip=\"状态条目\">呆滞 1</a>（1天）</p>\n<hr>\n<p>注：该疾病本身不会杀死受腐尸症折磨的生物。死亡效果会在诅咒造成足够的虚能伤害使该生物进入濒死后生效。</p>"
    ],
