    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<p>Many healers and alchemists suspect that sewer haze has a supernatural origin, given its association with particularly strong otyughs.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw:</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"fort\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"fort DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fort\" data-pf2-dc=\"23\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 23</span> Fortitude</span></a></p>\n<p><strong>Onset:</strong> 2 Days</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stage 1</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\">Stupefied 2</a> (1 day)</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 2</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\" data-id=\"4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\">Drained 2</a> and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\">Stupefied 2</a> (1 day)</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 3</strong>: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\" data-id=\"4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\">Drained 3</a> and <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\">Stupefied 3</a> (1 day)</li>\n</ul>",
      "<p>许多治疗者与炼金术师怀疑下水道痴呆症具有超自然的起源，因为它与格外强大的食腐怪有关。</p>\n<p><strong>豁免检定：</strong> <a class=\"inline-check with-repost\" data-pf2-repost-flavor=\"fort\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\" data-pf2-label=\"fort DC\" data-pf2-check=\"fort\" data-pf2-dc=\"23\"><span class=\"label\"><span data-visibility=\"gm\">DC 23</span> 强韧</span></a></p>\n<p><strong>潜伏期：</strong> 2 天</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>阶段 1</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\">呆滞2</a> （1 天）</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 2</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\" data-id=\"4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\">流失2</a> 以及 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\">呆滞2</a> （1 天）</li>\n<li><strong>阶段 3</strong>： <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\" data-id=\"4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR\">流失3</a> 以及 <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"pf2e.conditionitems\" data-uuid=\"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\" data-id=\"e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg\">呆滞3</a>（1 天）</li>\n</ul>"
    ],
