    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<p>The stack of loose papers and scrolls contain a wealth of information about <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.YbOS6pQRxoWI0Q56.JournalEntryPage.efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-id=\"efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"Text Page\">Gauntlight</a>. These papers are written in Aklo; sorting and then reading them takes 8 hours, after which the reader can learn about Gauntlight's functions as if they'd fully researched the artifact.</p>",
      "<p>这叠散页和卷轴包含大量关于<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.YbOS6pQRxoWI0Q56.JournalEntryPage.efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-id=\"efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"文本页\">凄凉灯塔</a>的信息。文稿以邪灵语写成；整理并阅读需要8小时，之后读者便能了解凄凉灯塔的功能，如同已彻底研究过这件神器。</p>"
    ],
    "sourceAnchors": [
      "<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.YbOS6pQRxoWI0Q56.JournalEntryPage.efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-id=\"efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"Text Page\">Gauntlight</a>"
    ],
    "translatedAnchors": [
      "<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.YbOS6pQRxoWI0Q56.JournalEntryPage.efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-id=\"efRUYLBH9Kf3CLkX\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"文本页\">凄凉灯塔</a>"
    ],
