    "acceptedHTML": [
      "<img src=\"modules/tianzes-gauntlight-extras/Assets/Portraits/Aesephna-Closeup-Framed.webp\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">This entry builds on the original biographical entry for the Roseguard found here: <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.DQepDGIcXuhkYOuU.JournalEntryPage.Gx2mnbeUctXU7XUN\" data-id=\"Gx2mnbeUctXU7XUN\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"Text Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.6em;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">The Roseguard</a></span></p><hr><p>Aesephna joined when Otari asked her to. She didn't really think of herself as an adventuring priest, because clerics of Eristil rarely do, but the goals of the Roseguard matched her own, and she had aspirations beyond that of a temple cleric.</p><p>She reluctantly took command of the group at Vol's request.</p><p>She has proven to be a better leader than even she ever expected, and Vol is her best supporter.</p><p>She returns Otari's affection, but vowed to remain chaste until she resumes temple duty. She has the Holy trait.</p><p>Vol has granted her the nickname of \"Sef\".</p><p>@UUID[Actor.CwC6aBucr3HvAFoL]{Aesephna's Ghost}</p>",
      "<img src=\"modules/tianzes-gauntlight-extras/Assets/Portraits/Aesephna-Closeup-Framed.webp\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">本条目基于此处所载的玫瑰团原始传记条目扩展而来：<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.DQepDGIcXuhkYOuU.JournalEntryPage.Gx2mnbeUctXU7XUN\" data-id=\"Gx2mnbeUctXU7XUN\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"文本页\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.6em;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">玫瑰团</a></span></p><hr><p>艾斯法娜是在奥塔里请求她加入时加入的。她并不真的认为自己是个冒险的祭司，因为埃拉斯蒂尔的牧师很少如此，但玫瑰团的目标与她自己的目标一致，而她也怀有超越神殿牧师职责的抱负。</p><p>在沃尔提出请求时，她勉为其难地接过了队伍的指挥权。</p><p>事实证明，她成为了一位比连她自己都预期更出色的领袖，而沃尔是她最坚定的支持者。</p><p>她也回应着奥塔里的爱慕，但她发誓在重返神殿履职之前保持贞洁。她具有圣洁特征。</p><p>沃尔给了她“赛芙”的昵称。</p><p>@UUID[Actor.CwC6aBucr3HvAFoL]{艾斯法娜的幽灵}</p>"
    ],
    "sourceAnchors": [
      "<a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.DQepDGIcXuhkYOuU.JournalEntryPage.Gx2mnbeUctXU7XUN\" data-id=\"Gx2mnbeUctXU7XUN\" data-type=\"JournalEntryPage\" data-tooltip=\"Text Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;cursor:pointer;background:rgb(221, 221, 221);padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-dark-tertiary);border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.6em;color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:Signika, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">The Roseguard</a>"
    ],
